        "404":
          description: "status_metadata_not_found: no status metadata with this id that you can see (a malformed id, an unknown or hidden one, or one deleted while this request waited); stage_not_found: the stage named (stage_id) does not exist in this account, or was deleted while this request waited; drip_track_not_found: likewise for drip_track_id. Nothing written."
